derived from gophertunnel and remains under its MIT license. The Dragonfly helper (configs/servers/dragonfly/) is built
against Dragonfly. Release binaries of the bots and the helper contain code from these projects and from their own module
dependencies; `go version -m <binary>` lists every module compiled into a binary.

